# Who may publish or read which topic.
# Topics: hestia/<site>/<device>/{telemetry,ack,status,cmd} and hestia/<site>/heating
# (prefix = HESTIA_TOPIC_PREFIX; change "hestia" below if you change it).

# The gateway: everything under its prefix.
user hestia-gateway
topic readwrite hestia/#

# Each controller logs in with its device id as username (%u) and may only
# publish its own telemetry, acknowledgements and status, and read its own
# commands. A stolen controller cannot read or command another one.
pattern write hestia/+/%u/telemetry
pattern write hestia/+/%u/ack
pattern write hestia/+/%u/status
pattern read hestia/+/%u/cmd
